-<section class="chapter"><div class="chapter-label">01</div><div><h2>Physical ports make the target explicit.</h2><p>For each flux–charge pair, the ideal plant is dΦ/dt=Q/C+V and dQ/dt=−Φ/L+I. Common action products S₀=Φ₀Q₀ and energy E₀ set the physical clock t₀=S₀/E₀. Active voltage and current commands cancel the normalized plant and add the selected CD-1 field.</p><p>The manuscript gives the commands and complete Hamiltonian. These are functional port requirements; component selection, loading, bandwidth, gains and controller work still need actual records.</p></div></section>
