h2>Additional-workstream narrative manuscript captured</h2><p>Review candidate 0.15 is preserved as a separate synthesis with its original PDF hash, complete text extract and page index. Intake preserves source status and leaves scientific replay, independent review and physical correspondence gates unchanged.</p><p><a class="text-link" href="/papers/#narrative-v015">Read the manuscript →</a> · <a class="text-link" href="/sources/narrative-v0.15/INGEST_RECEIPT_v0.1.json">Intake record ↓</a></p></article><article><time>13 October 2026</time><h3>Receipt gap and common deadline</h3><p>34 write slots; 44 versus 66 total-slot comparisons. Dimensionless probability does not select physical energy or area.</p><a class="citation" href="/sources/?id=R40">R40 ↗</a></article><article><time>13 October 2026</time><h3>Native signature and refinement</h3><p>Fixed-carrier skew flow does not choose a spatial refinement. Strict unit-readout/intertwining interface fails.</p><a class="citation" href="/sources/?id=R29">R29 ↗</a> <a class="citation" href="/sources/?id=R30">R30 ↗</a> <a class="citation" href="/sources/?id=R34">R34 ↗</a></article><article><time>13 October 2026</time><h3>POC-1 custody gap</h3><p>Original sidecar bytes and eligible target-hidden native episode remain required before a score.</p><a class="citation" href="/sources/?id=R35">R35 ↗</a></article><article><time>9–11 October 2026</time><h3>Predictive masks and typed event inputs</h3><p>Structural predicates, current observations and event source laws retain separate roles.</p><a class="citation" href="/sources/?id=R09">R09 ↗</a> <a class="citation" href="/sources/?id=R28">R28 ↗</a></article></details></div></section><section class="chapter"><div class="chapter-label">03</div><div><h2>Historical planning snapshot.</h2><details class="atlas-collection"><summary>Inspect the earlier work plan <span>Historical planning, not current status</span></summary></div></div></section><section class="chapter"><div class="chapter-label">03</div><div><h2>The next scientific priority.</h2><p><strong>Source the native event-response law and independently review the corrected conditional domain.</strong> The presentation now exposes every ledger row and its reuse limits. The remaining hinge is scientific: an independently sourced constitutive response, complete proof dependencies and an eligible test. A better reading surface does not supply that law.</p><p>Priority judgment: <strong>96/100</strong>. This score ranks expected progress and information value; it is not a measured closure percentage.</p></div></section><section class="chapter"><div class="chapter-label">04</div><div><h2>Coverage limitations.</h2><ul class="checklist"><li>One missing image: Gap2_FINAL_Finite_Genesis.png.</li><li>Nine standalone equation placeholders and 55 placeholder archive entries.</li><li>Raw notebooks include internal/patent material; scientific topics are inventoried.</li><li>Memory crosswalk covers available project context, not all unexported conversations.</li><li>Archived source labels are searchable, but not automatically current.</li></ul><p>Core mathematical checks are exact constructor verification. Human review and physical evaluation remain separate gates. No numerical closure meter is invented.</p></div></section></details></div></section></main><footer><div><a href="/">Unified Dynamics</a><p>Benjamin Walker Mayes · Independent researcher<br>AI-assisted research · Public atlas</p></div><div><a href="/sources/">Sources & coverage</a><a href="/contribution/">Contribution</a><a href="https://tetrahedral-packet-complexes.ben-w-mayes.chatgpt.site/">Living research portal ↗</a></div><p class="footer-rule">Proof, simulation and physical correspondence retain distinct evidence status. Physical promotion: 0.</p></footer></div></body></html>
